div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20250629110319&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Critical_Hit_Chance_Element_74a66f.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+0.50% critical extra hit chance for Ice spells and runes</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Ice Critical Extra Damage\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20250629110318&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Critical_Extra_Damage_Element_bc18f4.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+2% critical extra damage for Ice spells and runes</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Ice Critical Hit Chance\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20250629110319&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Critical_Hit_Chance_Element_74a66f.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+0.50% critical extra hit chance for Ice spells and runes</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Ice Critical Extra Damage\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20250629110318&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Critical_Extra_Damage_Element_bc18f4.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+2% critical extra damage for Ice spells and runes</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Ice Critical Hit Chance\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20250629110319&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Critical_Hit_Chance_Element_74a66f.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+1% critical extra hit chance for Ice spells and runes</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Ice Critical Extra Damage\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20250629110318&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Critical_Extra_Damage_Element_bc18f4.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+4% critical extra damage for Ice spells and runes</div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Origin\">Origin</span></h4>\n<p>Snowballs were implemented with Update 6.5 when <a href=\"#/wiki/Snow%20Heap\">Snow Heaps</a> were temporarily added to cities such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> as part of Christmas 2001. Due to players <i>heavily misusing snowballs for powergaming</i>, this event was not repeated the following Christmas.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Snowball_Bug\">Snowball Bug</span></h2>\n<p>Around the year 2004 or 2005 (before the walls of the mountains and many places were revamped, and you could use parcels everywhere to go up and down), there was a bug on Secura that a tree near Santa's House was deleted and players were able to reach one of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Snow%20Heap\">Snow Heaps</a>. The snow heap was the source of snowballs, and that day many snowballs were created.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Current_Availability\">Current Availability</span></h2>\n<p>Later on, they became semi-rare items since they were only available from the <a href=\"#/quest/goblin-temple-quest\">Goblin Temple Quest</a> on <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a>, as a loot from <a href=\"#/wiki/Yeti\">Yetis</a> or as a gift from <a href=\"#/wiki/Santa%20Claus\">Santa Claus</a>.\n</p><p>There came a large boost in the number of snowballs in-game during Christmas 2006, when <a href=\"#/wiki/Grynch%20Clan%20Goblin\">Grynch Clan Goblins</a> dropped a fairly large number of snowballs and other items. \n</p><p>They became even more common when <a href=\"#/quest/the-colours-of-magic\">The Colours of Magic</a> was implemented with the possibility of many creatures dropping snowballs for one week when Furb of Fun (orange colour) wins.\n</p><p>Finally, with the introduction of the <a href=\"#/quest/winterlight-solstice\">Winterlight Solstice</a> event in December 2018, Snowballs became much more available, since they can be created without limit by using <a href=\"#/wiki/Snow%20Heap\">Snow Heaps</a> on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Percht%20Island\">Percht Island</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"w-cite_note-1\"><b>^</b> <span class=\"reference-text\">Christmas Update 2002</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Snowman\">Animated Snowman</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grynch%20Clan%20Goblin\">Grynch Clan Goblin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yeti\">Yeti</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Snowman\">Animated Snowman</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Apes\">Apes</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arctic%20Faun\">Arctic Faun</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Barbarian%20Brutetamer\">Barbarian Brutetamer</a></li><li>Distance Weapons</li><li>Event Creatures</li><li>Giants</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/goblin-temple-quest\">Goblin Temple Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grynch%20Clan%20Goblin\">Grynch Clan Goblin</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hirintror\">Hirintror</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Isle%20of%20Merriment\">Isle of Merriment</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Large%20Snowball\">Large Snowball</a></li><li>Living and Dead</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/nimmersatts-lair\">Nimmersatt's Lair</a></li><li>One-Handed</li><li>Quests</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a></li><li>Rookgaard Equipment</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Santa%20Claus\">Santa Claus</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Snow%20Heap\">Snow Heap</a></li><li>Snowball Missile</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-colours-of-magic\">The Colours of Magic</a></li><li>The Forbidden Build</li><li>Throwing Weapons</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tjured%20%28Creature%29\">Tjured (Creature)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Unrealized%20Dream\">Unrealized Dream</a></li><li>Weapon Proficiency</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/winterlight-solstice\">Winterlight Solstice</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yeti\">Yeti</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["goblin-temple-quest","nimmersatts-lair","the-colours-of-magic","winterlight-solstice"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"goblin-temple-quest","quest":"Goblin Temple Quest","kind":"reward"},{"slug":"nimmersatts-lair","quest":"Nimmersatt's Lair","step":"2-0","n":3,"title":"Apanhar Snowballs","kind":"mention","coords":[]},{"slug":"the-colours-of-magic","quest":"The Colours of Magic","step":"4-0","n":11,"title":"Bónus para todo o servidor","kind":"mention","coords":[]},{"slug":"winterlight-solstice","quest":"Winterlight Solstice","step":"1-2","n":6,"title":"Fazer uma bola de neve grande","kind":"mention","coords":[]}],"drops":[{"creature":"Yeti","pct":52.991,"qty":"1-22","hp":"950","exp":"460","loc":"Folda - here , Chyllfroest - here . Isle of Merriment - During a Test Servers Monster Rampage here .","places":[{"name":"Folda","x":32020,"y":31572,"z":7,"href":"#/wiki/Folda"},{"name":"Chyllfroest","x":32060,"y":31034,"z":7,"href":"#/wiki/Chyllfroest"},{"name":"Isle of Merriment","x":31949,"y":31805,"z":7,"href":"#